ds on lands that were originally occupied by the first people of this area, Mechoopda , and we recognize their distinctive spiritual relationship with this land, the flora, the fauna, and the waters that run through campus. We are humbled that our campus resides upon sacred lands that since time immemorial have sustained the Mechoopda people and continue to do so today. Contact Us Need Help? Report an accessibility issue Report a broken link on this page Title IX Privacy Policy California State University, Chico 400 West First Street Chico, CA 95929 Copyright © 2026 All Rights Reserved Back to top"
